  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HRD Scheme affords the opportunity for the Representative Office Ramallah (ROR) to build strong partnerships with civil society actors in the human rights field and also facilitates ROR&#x2019;s access to up to date and factual information as to what is happening on the ground. One of  MIFTAH&apos;s focuses is to highlight the gender specific abuses faced by Palestinian women.</narrative>
